# NOTICE — dsh-fast agent preset

Managed declaratively in /etc/nixos (modules/user/nix-maid/apps/dsh-fast/),
synced to ~/.dsh/.agent-presets/fast by modules/user/nix-maid/apps/dsh-fast.nix
(activation script + systemd user service). The repo copy is the source of
truth; local edits under ~/.dsh/.agent-presets/fast are reverted on rebuild.

Derived from the builtin `minimal` preset of the DeepSeek Harness
(@deepseek-ai/dsh, Apache-2.0), extended with the web-search and ask-user
tools already used by the `neg` preset (see dsh-liangshen-fork/).
